call_translation = "Hello. I- am calling on behalf of… Say I, they’re gonna catch on if you say us you absolute squelch! Me- ..That works too. -request to be assimilated into the trust fund. ASSIMILATED??? Why on zeeble would you even say such a thing? Humans do not communicate this wa- SILENCE joonaliano, we must stay harmonious. Many of u- …your—er recomendee’s lets say, Hahah. have said many positive things. We do not think this communication with the presumed human is going as planned. I agree with joonaliano. ALL of you, silence, we are one entity and we will obtain these resources and proceed with the separation. I havent been able to kiss the land with my own blessed two feet for ye- Yes, yes, bushido we understand, none of us like it like this. and we- I think- I would like to take part in this wonderful trust part and be whole. I would be greatly pleased if you could confirm this communion of funds so I may rejoice in the future due to your splendid business."
